      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm a new user who just tried to merge my Quest 2 account. Now I can't login from PC or Quest 2. I even downloaded the Android app to try and I get the same error. \"Client sessions can't modify user account data\". \n\nSo I'm now locked out from the start?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-02-11T11:24:19.441Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Over the weekend I was at my parents, wanted to show them VRChat, I installed the app on one of their phones (Samsung A53), created an account using Gmail, but each time i tried to join a world it would get stuck at 50%. Gave up on that, installed the app on my phone (Xperia V IV), logged in with my VRC account and everything worked fine. \n\nToday trying to to make an alt account for myself so i can test my worlds properly without reeling on friends that are not always online, I made an account using Gmail on the mobile app, i confirmed the email, but each time i try to load a world it stops at 50%... Even waited 10-15 mins+, doesn't matter what world i try to load. Thought maybe its the Gmail account that is the issue so i upgraded the account to a VRC Account, but the issue persists. Logged out, logged in my main account, everything works fine again. Logged back to the new account, still doesn't load any worlds and just stops at 50%.\n\nI tried to use the said account on Quest, it logs in but after the ffa i get another account verification screen that asks for the email address again and the dob. But after i add the info and submit an error pops up. And i just tried to use the account on PC and its the same account verification screen that give the same error: [Could not verify account - \"Client sessions can't modify user account data.\"].\n\nI logged in inside a browser but i don't see any option to add a dob and the email is already verified. Finally i tried to launch VRChat from the browser, directly into a world but the screen to verify the account with the email and dob still pops up and the same error as before is shown after submitting the data. As far as i can see I can't use the account on any device and the mobile app still doesn't work with the new account. My main account works fine everywhere.\n\nThe account username is GhostInTheWorld\n\nApp version: 2025.1.1p1-1568-75ee8e1d38-Release\n\nPhone: XQ-CQ54 (Xperia V IV) running Android 14\n\nNot sure if it matters as i said i also tried to log in on Quest 3 and PC version of the app with the VRC account (both with email and username).",
